(a) *New Orleans Register*. The New Orleans Register is hereby established which shall, at least on a monthly basis, publish official publications, including, but not limited to, advertisements, public notices, official proceedings, and official information required by:

(1) Home Rule Charter sections: 3-113, 3-123, 4-107, 5-404, and 9-201;

(2) Louisiana Revised Statutes chapters: 18:1292, 33:3524, 33:4083, and 33:4091;

(3) Other laws mandating publication of adopted actions in the official journal or in a publication other than a newspaper.

