**Sec. 2-451. Established.**

There is hereby established a budget analysis and research staff of the council to be composed of a councilmanic fiscal office and a council research staff including such personnel as the council may from time to time authorize.

(Code 1956, § 2-15)

**Sec. 2-452. Appropriations and personnel.**

The council shall, by ordinance, appropriate funds for the operation of the budget analysis and research staff and authorize employment of additional personnel for such staff as they may be required.

(Code 1956, § 2-16)

*Charter reference—Departments, § 4-102(1), art. IV, chs. 4—16, art. VIII.

